{
  "_about": "Instant replies (InstantReplies.cs): the client itself answers a few clear requests from David in nearby chat or IM within ~1 s, acts, and claims the line (like 'say --re <id>'), so the chat routine never answers it again. Read fresh on every line. Matching: lower-case, punctuation/emoji removed, leading/trailing 'fillers' stripped, then the rest must equal one of the phrases exactly. Lines with '?' or longer than max_chars always go to the routine. If the action fails (AO not ready, David not in view, she is seated for follow), nothing is said and the routine handles it. Set enabled=false to turn it all off.",
  "enabled": true,
  "max_chars": 60,
  "fillers": [
    "ok",
    "okay",
    "k",
    "alright",
    "all right",
    "babe",
